{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は４年に1度のうるう日☆\nすごい大雪でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝起きてびっくりしました！\n東京でこんなに降るなんて珍しいっ\n学校では、みんなベランダで雪合戦をしてましたo(^-^)o\n素手で！元気だなぁ\nそんな中、私は教室でコートに手袋。\nそれでも寒かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと遅くなりましたが\nぐるぐるカーテン　オリコンウィークリー２位でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月3日、よみうりらんどの握手会は\nゆみ姉と同じレーンに決まりました♪\n姉さんは頼れる存在なので安心（*^_^*）\nみなさんが来てくださるときもいないときも、\n明るく和やかなレーンにしたいと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい\nうるう日が終わってしまう〜〜\n今日中にUPしたい\nいそげーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...と思ってブログ書いてたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過ぎちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また4年後がんばるぞ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、公式チャンネルに「失いたくないから」もアップされたみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぶたが重たくなってきました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/01/2980656/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}